window.products.push({"id":1089129,"name":"TraGoods 16 Pack White Clothing Rack Size Dividers Plus 60 Labels (1 Inch) and 16 Large Blank Labels, Large Rectangular Clothing Closet Dividers (Pear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D2j3DhPcL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Product Include: 1. Blank White Clothing Dividers *16 (5.35 * 3.55 inch) 2. 1 inch Printed Label * 45 (3 sheet)  3. 1 inch Blank Label * 15 (1 sheet)  4. Large Blank Label * 16 (2 sheet) (3 * 2 inch) Material: Safe and Environmentally friendly plastic Package Size : 13.4 * 9.45 * 1.6 inch (L*W*H) Product Description: In our daily lives, adult or baby clothing stored in baby nurseries, adult wardrobes, children's wardrobes, and even laundry rooms requires us to carefully organize our clothes.  Every day, you need to arrange your clothes so that you can get ready for dressing faster, or let your family member know the classification of the clothes. Using Tragoods Clothing Dividers, you can easily find their size, color, and type, and never ignore a piece of clothing. Let our lives be more organized. Tragoods Clothing Dividers is 5.35 inches high and 3.5 inches wide, it is easy to see between clothes. With plenty of space, you can decorate your clothing dividers for extra style.  These large dividers are suitable for any closet and are suitable for 0.71-1.55inch hanger size. You can use them to organize baby nurseries, adult wardrobes, children's wardrobes and even laundry rooms! They are made of durable plastic and can withstand use. USE: 1. Please do not use the pen directly on the Clothing Dividers. It's recommended to put our label paper on Clothing Dividers and the write. 2. After the label is attached, it is something not easy to remove, and it can be removed more easily by using the hair dryer to heat the label position. You can also attach a new label directly to the original location without emoving it. 3. This product supports re-use. We have tried many times to prove that this shape of clothing dividers is the most conspicuous and best used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D2j3DhPcL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tragoods","source_asin":"B0C2CF57PL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2CF57PL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2CF57PL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
