window.products.push({"id":1089361,"name":"Santorini Sunset Wall Decor by John Xiong, 6 by 19\" Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-ozWjGPYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features houses along a winding road with a sunset on the horizon. Dr. John Xiong has a unique vision of Australia and the world. His photographs capture the magic and beautiful moments - moments that are there for all to see, but which most let slip by unnoticed. John'S photographs are widely published by leading art publishers in Australia, Europe, and the us. John was educated in science, although photography has always been his passion. He received his PhD at the university of Gottingen, Germany in 1990 and worked at prominent research institutions as a scientist in Canada, the us, and Australia. His career as a scientist also gave him extensive opportunities to travel and to live around the world, which allowed him to explore his keen passion in photography. This gradually changed him from a scientist to a professional photographer. His scientific training has greatly helped him develop photographic techniques of his own style. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-ozWjGPYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00XQYE36E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XQYE36E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XQYE36E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1089362,"name":"Kxuhivc Portable Air Conditioner Windows Vent Kit, Adjustable Window Seal with 5.9 Inch Diameter, 78.7 Inch Length Exhaust Hose for A/C Unit Universal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jYN5GPRaS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ANTI-CLOCKWISE UNIVERSAL FIT: Our AC exhaust hose has an anti-clockwise thread direction so make sure to check this is correct for your AC before purchasing. The diameter of our AC hose is 5.9 inches, the length has two options for 1.5m/59\" and 2m/78.7\" respectively, which means it can fit most portable air conditioners on the market. DURABLE & WIDE COMPATIBILITY: The window vent kit for portable AC unit consists of four plates, is made of durable PVC materials, recommended max extend length 162cm/64Inch, light weight, portable, suit for using in home or office. EASY TO INSTALL: Just set the plate panels together and slide them to the desired length, and then lock with screws. Attach one side of exhaust hose to the air conditioner hose connector by rotating; Attach another side of hose to the adaptor. Finally insert to the plates. GOOD SEALING: There is gap between fixing plate and adjustable plate, because of adjustable plate narrower than fixing plate. So come with dealing tape, it is posted at the connection between the sliding door and the sealing plate, which effectively isolates hot air from entering the room and fixed every plate. PACKAGE INCLUDES: 1 x Exhaust Hose (Dia15cm/5.9Inch), 1 x Exhaust Hose Adaptor, 2 x 43cm/17Inch Fixing Outer Plates, 2 x 43cm/17Inch Adjustable Inner Plates, 3 x Screws, 1 x Sealing Tapes, please check your sliding door size before buying. If you have any problems, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jYN5GPRaS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kxuhivc","source_asin":"B093WTDK51","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093WTDK51","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093WTDK51","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
