window.products.push({"id":1089366,"name":"Rechargeable Camping Fan with LED Lantern, 20000mAh Auto-Oscillating Battery Operated Desk Fan with Remote/Hook/Timer, 8” Portable Fan for Picnic, Fis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OUPBG4q2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Working Long Time&4 Speeds】The camping fan can work for 16-60 hours after being fully charged (depending on 4 wind speeds), and the battery indicators help you keep track of the remaining power. Built-in 5V/3A type-C input/output port and a 5V/2A USB output port for charging the fan conveniently, or as a power bank to power other USB devices mobile phones, cameras, GPS, iPod. It's a lifesaver during camping, travel, power outages, and hurricane season. 【Strong Airflow and LED Light】With the unique design of double 3-blade fans (backward on each side of the fan housing that blows in tandem), it blows quite a bit of air, even if at the lowest speed. 3-level brightness lights, soft and non-glare lights, designed to meet your outdoor lighting needs at night. The nighttime mode allows you to turn off the indicator lights on the base to help keep the darkness and sleep better. 【Auto-Oscillating & Rotation Head】The portable fan can horizontally auto-oscillate within 90° or 45°, 270° head rotation up and down. So you can direct the light and air easily to where you want it, increasing air circulation and light brightness. A 360° rota-table and fold-able hook at the bottom for hanging the tent fan anywhere you want. 【Remote Control and Timer】You can control the battery-powered fan easily by remote from as far as 16.4 ft away. And the remote can be stored in the slot at the side of the base to avoid missing. The working time of the fan can be selected according to your needs, the timers with 4 modes are 1H/2H/4H/8H. Note: Please remove the insulation strip in the remote before using it. 【Tailored for Every Occasion】This USB battery powered fan can meet your every need whether you're outdoors or indoors. Such as camping, barbecue, picnic, hiking, fishing, family gathering, and also suitable for indoor use as a desk fan when studying, working, reading, etc 【Anti-Drop&Portable】Made of sturdy and durable ABS material for anti-drop and anti-collision use. It is a professional outdoor device, Shapes designed for travel backpacks. 100% charging can be completed in 8hrs. You will get a worry-free 12-month warranty and 30-day money-back guarantee, friendly customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OUPBG4q2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"neofeel","source_asin":"B0C8S2SFS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8S2SFS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8S2SFS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
