window.products.push({"id":1089375,"name":"Plastic Hanger Clips 100 Pack - Strong Pinch Grip, Multi-Purpose Finger Clip for Slim-Line Baby Clothes & Velvet Clothing Hangers (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81clLll-rnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These multi-purpose clips for hangers easily attach to your slim-line clothes hangers to keep garments such as pants and skirts neat and tidy. The durable ABS plastic construction and strong clamp force hold garments securely, whilst the smooth edges mean an end to snagged, pulled clothing. Ideal for use with flocked or velvet clothes hangers, these pants hanger clips add an extra level of storage to your closet. These premium pants hanger clips have a wide variety of uses around the home! Attach a row of these 2\"\" x 0.79\"\" x 0.9\"\" plastic finger clips to your usual hangers to store scarves, ties, and other accessories neatly in one place. The gliding action of these clothes hanger clips means that all sizes and styles of items are catered for! With no-slip teeth and an all-plastic composition, these clothes hanger fixtures will firmly grip any fabric without damaging it. The smart black color and robust design of our grip clips for hangers will create a uniform look in your closet, whilst offering practicality. Available in a pack of 100, there are more than enough plastic finger clips for the whole family to use. DECOZY is a brand specialized in most types of daily use hangers, wooden & velvet hangers, plastic & metal wonder clothes hangers. We promise to uphold our pledge to produce high-quality, long-lasting, and safest products. Product Details: Brand: DECOZY Material: ABS Plastic Size (Single Clip): 2\"\" L x .79” W x .9\"\" in. H Gross Weight: 3lbs (1.36 kg) Package Content: 100 X Plastic Hanger Clips","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81clLll-rnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DECOZY","source_asin":"B096KFQJKY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096KFQJKY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096KFQJKY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1089376,"name":"Vickerman 3' Flocked Alpine Artificial Christmas Tree, Warm White LED Dura-Lit Lights - Snow Covered Faux Tree - Seasonal Indoor Home Decor - Real Woo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zhSUm5RIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Vickerman 3' Flocked Alpine Artificial Christmas Tree, 142 PVC tips and 50 Warm White LED Lights. This flocked Alpine can be incorporated into holiday or everyday rustic décor. It features Dura-Lit LED lights, medium flocked tips, a real wood trunk, and a flat Metal base is included. It has energy efficient dura-lit LED lights which means when one or more bulbs do not function, the rest of the strand will stay lit. For additional complimentary accents see the many wreaths and garlands available from Vickerman. This durable tree is maintenance free and will suit any decor. Vickerman has been an industry leader since 1940. Enjoy this expert designed seasonal tree around your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zhSUm5RIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vickerman","source_asin":"B00EB1SXS0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EB1SXS0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EB1SXS0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1089377,"name":"Emile Henry Delight Induction Tagine, 2 Litres","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CKLRbHWWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our 'Delight' tajine allows you to make delicious traditional tajines and other simmering dishes on all hobs (including induction). It is made from state-of-the-art ceramic and is lightweight and highly responsive to pick up or solve. In addition, it spreads heat evenly to gently simmer and reveal the most delicate flavours. The result is soft, fluffy and concentrated in aromas thanks to the unique shape of the lid which allows the evaporated cooking juices to circulate. The clean lines of its white lid and its generous matt black base ensure an elegant table service and sublime all recipes, exotic or more traditional. With its technical enamel, 100% waterproof of a natural non-stick, it is easy to clean and dishwasher safe. Handcrafted and controlled in our workshops in Burgundy, the 'Delight' tajine is guaranteed for 5 years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CKLRbHWWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B07XL4BM4R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XL4BM4R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XL4BM4R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
