window.products.push({"id":1089498,"name":"GENMOUS 3 Tier Black Metal Wire Cupcake Stands Display For Birthday Party Decoration, Stackable Cake Stand Dessert Table Display Set, Appetizers Buffe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i1mIeNHLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎂🌿 Modern and Versatile Set of 3 Display Risers: These stylish metal wire square food display risers come in a set of three with varying heights, making them perfect for use in a variety of settings. Whether you're looking to display cupcakes, desserts, or even use them as plant holders, these versatile display risers are sure to impress. 🖤 Sleek and Stylish Design: Featuring a modern square design with a matte black finish, these cupcake stand are sure to complement any decor style. The sleek and stylish look of these metal display risers makes them perfect for use in modern spaces, including in retail settings or in your home. 📏 Varying Heights for Dynamic Displays: With three different heights, you'll have endless ways when it comes to displaying your items. The varying heights of these display risers allow you to create dynamic displays that are sure to catch the eye of anyone passing by. 💪 Durable and Long-Lasting: Made from sturdy metal wire, these food risers are built to last. Whether you're using them to display cakes or cupcakes and desserts in a bakery or restaurant, or as plant holders in your home, these display risers will stand up to frequent use and handling. 🧼 Lightweight and Easy to Clean: When it comes to cleaning these display stand, you'll be happy to know that they are easy to wipe down and keep looking their best. They're also lightweight, making them easy to move and store when not in use. Plus, they're suitable for use both indoors and outdoors, giving you even more options for display. 🛁Ease of Use and Storage: These set of 3 cupcake stand that is easy to assemble, use, and clean. Display riser is easy to store in a compact manner when not in use. Save more kitchen conter space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i1mIeNHLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GENMOUS & CO.","source_asin":"B0BRXCGPYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRXCGPYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRXCGPYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1089499,"name":"LARGE FISH MOLD","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512KxXwCtIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512KxXwCtIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJRB54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJRB54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJRB54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
