window.products.push({"id":1089585,"name":"Sango Nova Black 16-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":81.72,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417T32PYZTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description A unique look of reactive glaze gradation from a sophisicated black to a soft white. Four each, dinner plates(10.5\"), salad plates (7.5\"), soup/cereal bowls and mugs, all stoneware body. Amazon.com Inspired by the artisan pottery of Central Java, Indonesia, Sango dinnerware items are handcrafted so that no two pieces are exactly alike. Guests will be delighted by the simple construction, slightly retro-Asian style, and the use of rich, earthy shades of color progressing from dark edges to light centers. The lustrous glaze harmonizes with a variety of decorative styles and occasions, while simultaneously creating a noticeable presence on the table. Enveloped in a dramatic black glaze covering the exterior of all bowls and plates, and the inside of each mug, the Nova Black collection also employs shades of blue, green, tan, and cream to create a distinctive dinnerware pattern. This 16-piece set encompasses four 10-1/2-inch dinner plates, four 7-1/2-inch salad plates, four 6-1/2-inch soup/cereal bowls, and four 10-ounce mugs. Handcrafted from durable stoneware, each item can be placed in the microwave or dishwasher. --Lea Werbel What's in the Box Dinnerware set. Each place setting includes: 10-1/2-inch dinner plate; 7-1/2-inch salad plate; 6-1/2-inch soup/cereal bowl; 10-ounce mug. 16 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417T32PYZTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sango","source_asin":"B0008DJHO4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0008DJHO4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0008DJHO4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1089586,"name":"Palmero Concepts Large Ramen Bowl Set of 2 - With 10 Pieces - Black Large Ceramic Bowl, Matching Ceramic Soup Spoon, Wooden Chopsticks and Spoon, Suit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+2HbnZGAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For anyone who loves to share a meal with loved ones, this traditional large soup bowl set will transport their tableware to stylish new heights. This stunning Japanese bowl set, all displayed in a beautiful gift box, contains two restaurant-quality large ceramic bowls, two matching ceramic soup spoons, two sets of wooden chopsticks, two traditional wooden spoons, and even a wooden spoon holder to complete the professional-grade large ceramic bowls set. Hand-painted and hand-dipped into strong, smooth glaze, these inspired large ceramic bowls are top-quality for your favorite dishes at any temperature. Unlike other glazed bowls that scratch and scrape during mealtime or cleanup, or aren’t safe at high or low temperatures, this glaze stays durable and strong. And, use is a breeze- you can scrub, microwave, place in the oven, and clean in your dishwasher with no worry and no extra time spent in the kitchen. While other pho bowls claim to be large, this large ceramic bowl set is big enough to eat even the large takeout ramen or a whole carton of gelato from- it holds up to 60 oz of goodness. At 9 inches wide, the versatility of these bowls combined with their beauty makes your table special- whether you’re eating your daily supper or you’re hosting a fancy dinner party. And, unlike other large ceramic bowls, this Asian cookware is hand-glazed to withstand scratches and chips. Infuse hand-painted art inspired by Japanese cookware,  japanese ramen bowls, large pho bowls, chinese bowl, asian soup bowls, korean dishes, japanese dinner set  and asian tradition into your daily routine. Perfect for korean soup bowl, asian noodles, ramen bowels,","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+2HbnZGAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Palmero Concepts","source_asin":"B083C535JN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083C535JN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083C535JN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
