window.products.push({"id":1089792,"name":"nambe Kissing Salt & Pepper Shakers | 2-Piece Set | Kitchen Tool | Salt Sugar Spice Pepper Seasoning Bottle for Table, RV, Camp, BBQ | 1.5-Ounce | Mad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41V+IBPNQBL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description The two pieces of the hourglass-shaped Hug Salt & Pepper Shakers fit together in a sweet embrace, making it easy to carry the pair to the table as if they were one. Each has a differing number of holes on top and black and white plastic plugs underneath for identification. These Salt & Pepper Shakers feature a very simple and clean design to pair well with any existing kitchen dcor. Even in their simplicity they are still chic and unique enough to bring elegance to your dinner table. Perfect for everyday casual use and dinner party entertainment alike. Less than ten years after opening his studio in New York, Karim Rashid stands among the contemporary masters of design. Rashid works in architecture, interiors, fashion and furniture. He is also a sculptor, painter and ceramist with a number of prestigious one-man shows and exhibits to his credit. Recognized for its award-winning designs for more than 60 years, Nambes commitment to timeless beauty, artistic integrity and uncompromising quality is evident in the brands collection of serve ware, barware, home dcor and gift items. Nambe collaborates with the worlds most esteemed designers to develop products that bring function and style into the home. Package contains (1) Nambe Hug Salt & Pepper Shakers. Made of Namb Alloy. 1-Ounce. Measures 6-Inches H x 2.5-Inches W, each. Care instructions: hand wash, dry immediately. Designed by Karim Rashid in 1983. Amazon.com With the Kissing salt and pepper shakers, Nambé brings charming style to those most everyday spices. Designed to be a functional conversation starter at the table, the set cuts a sleek yet whimsical figure with a sweeping hourglass profile and a flat side where the two pieces nestle together. Both space-saving and mood-improving at home, the Kissing shakers have also won numerous design awards and been featured in the collections of museums from San Francisco to Seoul. They are crafted from Nambé's famed metal alloy, making them impervious to cracks and tarnish, and their hand-polished finish retains its gleam with minimal effort. Standing 5 inches high, the shakers should be washed by hand when necessary and refill easily from the bottom. Coordinating Nambé serveware is also available. --Emily Bedard What's in the Box 1 salt shaker; 1 pepper shaker. 2 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41V+IBPNQBL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nambe","source_asin":"B00005RE4N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005RE4N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005RE4N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1089793,"name":"CafePress Meh Mug Mugs Ceramic Coffee Mug, Tea Cup 15 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PrwIwM5OL._AC_.jpg","description":"The smooth, white ceramic and easy-grip handle feels great in your hand as you sip your morning brew, afternoon tea or evening hot chocolate. Use our 15oz mug at home or in the office as a pen holder, displaying the funny or cute design. The design is professionally printed, making it the perfect novelty gift for both men and women, young or old. And taking care of this coffee mug is a cinch, as it can be used in the dishwasher or microwave. With CafePress, your satisfaction is always our promise...buy with confidence, as we offer easy returns and exchanges.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PrwIwM5OL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CafePress","source_asin":"B088Q9WD6T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088Q9WD6T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088Q9WD6T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
