window.products.push({"id":1089822,"name":"Véfaîî Newest Digital Day Clock with Auto DST & 19 Alarms Reminders, 8\" Large Dementia Clocks with Date and Day of The Week,Desk Wall Clock for Senior","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e3+-WDsOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Large Display & Seniors-friendly 】 Véfaîî 8-inch large 1024x768 HD Calendar Clock clearly spells out the time and date with no confusing abbreviations! A handy remote control saves you from the trouble of moving the clock, adjustable up to 16 feets away! One-step nap/sleep button and auto night-dimming, perfect for the midday naps or night sleeps! By display BEFORE DAWN after midnight minimizes the problem of seniors getting up & start the day in the wee hours. ✅【19 Alarms & Custom Reminders, Messages 】 Véfaîî digital alarm clock is the only clock to include 19 alarms with colored image icons( Drink Some Water/Medications/Wash Your Hands ...etc.). No snooze buttons needed as the alarms can be turned off automatically or manually!! Besides, the clock allows you to custom more reminders or messages on the clock for important tasks or events, it's a great time-managment system ! Adjust each alarm and message separately. ✅【Auto Daylight Saving Time DST Adjustment】 Unlike the others, our calendar clock has now gained Daylight Saving Time to automatically adjust the DST time in March and October! Besides, Our clock has a handy remote control and you don't always have to touch keys on the clock- So Convenient! You can select different font colors and themes, great for school kids or vision impaired seniors ! ✅【Simple Setup and Time cycles】The digital clock comes with ready-to-use setup and users can custom the display modes as they need. Clock can show or remove the display MORNING, AFTERNOON, EVENING, NIGHT, BEFOREDAWN during the time: 5:00 am - 11:59 am (MORNING), 12:00 pm - 12:59 pm (NOON), 1:00 pm- 4:59 pm (AFTERNOON), 5:00 pm - 8:59 pm (EVENING), 9:00 pm - 11:59 pm (NIGHT), 12:00 am - 1:59am (MIDNIGHT), 2:00am- 5:59 am (BEFORE DAWN). 9 pm (NIGHT), 12:00 am - 1:59am (MIDNIGHT), 2:00am- 5:59 am (BEFORE DAWN). ✅【Easy to Use & Giftable Package】 With our handy remote control you can operate the clock from max.16 feets away - So Convenient! Large AM/PM or 24 Hour mode, non-abbrivation date mode can be DAY-MONTH-YEAR or MONTH-DAY-YEAR. The package does not show any texts of Memory Loss,Dementia,or Alzheimer's, perfect gift for the elderly or school students. ✅【Auto-dimming & Multi-language support】The digital clock with day and date automatically adjusts to dimming mode during sleeping hours, making it friendly to the sleepers. The digital clock for seniors supports multiple languages and offers different time formats, making it accessible to individuals who speak different languages. ***About Battery Backup: This day clock is electric (plug-in cord included), but has a battery to automatically reset time and save all settings. 🚩【Upgraded】 the clock can manually show or hide the Sun☀️Moon🌙 icons, which helps you better understand the periods of Day and Night !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e3+-WDsOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Véfaîî","source_asin":"B08QH97KVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QH97KVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QH97KVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
