window.products.push({"id":1089909,"name":"Spirited Away Bamboo Chopstick 2pcs Set -Anti-Slip Grip for Ease of Use - Authentic Japanese Design - Lightweight, Durable and Convenient","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617x3Fit5iL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Share a Meal with Spirited Away! When enjoying Japanese cuisine, chopsticks are a must-have. They allow you to pick up food with precision, yet won’t puncture what you’re eating like a fork does. But those unaccustomed to Asian utensils often find chopsticks cumbersome to use. With a set of Skater Studio Ghibli Spirited Away Chopsticks, you’ll effortlessly master these handy utensils! It’s all thanks to our anti-slip design, which gives you a secure grip on the chopsticks. From sushi to noodle bowls, they help you handle a wide range of Japanese dishes. Measuring 21cm (8.25in) in length, the standard size is comfortable and convenient for users of all experience levels. For a truly authentic experience, our design features Spirited Away! Licensed and approved by Studio Ghibli, you can rest assured knowing this is a genuine product imported from Japan. When it comes to quality chopsticks, look no further than bamboo! As a renewable resource, it’s strong, durable and easy on the environment. Best of all, it’s lightweight, allowing you to take your chopsticks to school or work for on-the-go eating. Why Choose Our Spirited Away? - Anti-slip and easy-to-use design- 2 different Spirited Away patterns- Lightweight for convenient carry- Authentic Japanese design- Made with durable bamboo Our Customer Service Team is Standing By! *Stock is limited. Order today to ensure availability. Order Your Chopsticks Now for Authentic Japanese Design!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617x3Fit5iL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Skater","source_asin":"B08DQBFD5F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DQBFD5F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DQBFD5F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
