window.products.push({"id":1089970,"name":"Marquis By Waterford Celebration Champagne Flutes, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XDtG2MjPL._AC_SL1033_.jpg","description":"Distinguished by their striking presence and enchanting sense of expression and grace, this set of two champagne flutes makes a glamorous addition to any home drinkware collection. The sophisticated vessels offer a versatile and elegant way to share a bottle of the classic celebratory drink--from pure white and golden varieties such as Blanc de blanc and Blanc de noir to the delicate family of Pink and Rose champagnes--with friends, guests, or that special someone during a romantic dinner for two. Crafted of dazzling clear glass with trumpet-shaped cups, the flutes feature etched starbursts that capture and scatter light with brilliance and clarity. Furthermore, they rise above slender, pulled stems that ensure a secure, comfortable hold when clinking glasses after making a toast to mark the occasion. Broad, circular bases contribute to their aesthetic appeal while offering stability when placed on a countertop or table. For best results, hand-wash the glasses one at a time in moderately hot water with mild lemon detergent and 1/4-cup ammonia to prevent spotting; then rinse in clean water and air-dry on a rack or dry with a soft, lint-free cloth. In addition to expanding one's own collection, the set of two champagne flutes also makes a delightful and fitting wedding, anniversary, or other special-occasion gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XDtG2MjPL._AC_SL1033_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marquis By Waterford","source_asin":"B00440D194","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089970","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00440D194","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00440D194","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
