window.products.push({"id":1089976,"name":"Rug Grippers Carpet Grippers Area Anti Curling Rug Gripper Carpet Gripper Renewable Carpet Tape, Renewable Skid Tape for Hardwood Floors (12pcs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AncgiKi-S._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Decorating your home with rugs and runners is an important part of your decor and style, of course having wood, tile, marble, or linoleum floors to add warmth and comfort. But when you put a rug on a floor like that, you run the risk of them slipping and sliding everywhere or the corner curling up; both of which can cause major accidents or injuries. That’s why we created Tumelu Anti-Curl Rug Gripper Tape that creates a strong, non-slip adhesive barrier between your floor and your rug to ensure they look great, enhance overall safety, and keep your home or office neat and welcoming. Product Details: · Complete Rug Gripper 12 Pack · Special Yellow Carpet Tape · Twice the Adhesive Strength · Hard Plastic Center (Instead of Gel) · Pet Friendly Durability · Quick and Easy Installation · Note: Does not work for rugs on carpeted flooring The smarter, ergonomic shape and advanced adhesive gives them a better hold without impacting comfort, style, or look, and blend is discretely without changing rug height. Read more This Rug Gripper can be used all over your home or office, including places like the living room, bedroom, baby’s nursery, indoor or outdoor patio, kitchen, bathroom, or den! Read more Superior Strength and Versatility Far better than standard rug gripper tapes made out of gel and don’t offer a lasting hold, these premier Tumelu anti-curling rug grippers offer two times the adhesive strength with special Yellow Carpet Tape and a Hard-Plastic Center to give them more strength, durability, and hold power. Read more Pet And Dog Sliding Proof These premium non-skid rug grippers help keep your rugs, carpets, or hallway runners from skidding, sliding, or bunching up, and can withstand almost every size dog, you can easily peel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AncgiKi-S._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAVAVE","source_asin":"B088D4GXTR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1089976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088D4GXTR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088D4GXTR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
